                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Globular"} Globular
                is a web-based proof assistant for finitely-presented semistrict globular higher categories. It allows one to formalize higher-categorical proofs in finitely-presented n-categories and visualize them as string diagrams.
          %div
            %h3#ReferencesQuantumInformationTheoryViaStringDiagrams Quantum information theory via String diagrams
            %h4#GeneralReferencesQuantumInformationTheoryViaStringDiagrams General
            %p
              The observation that a natural language for
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+information+theory"} quantum information theory
              and
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+computation"} quantum computation
              = succeed "," do
